      "summary_short": {
        "zh": "Unlimited-OCR是百度开源视觉语言模型，用于从图像中提取文本，涵盖多语言文档与场景照片。其基于Transformer特征提取及图像到文本生成技术，实现跨文字与版式的精准识别。优势包括广泛语言覆盖、稳健性能、MIT许可及社区应用广泛。典型用例涉及文档数字化、发票处理、自动化数据录入及生产级OCR流水线构建。",
        "en": "Unlimited-OCR is Baidu's open-source vision-language model that extracts text from images, including multilingual documents and scene photos. It uses transformer-based feature extraction and image-to-text generation, delivering accurate recognition across diverse scripts and lay…",
        "es": "Unlimited-OCR is Baidu's open-source vision-language model that extracts text from images, including multilingual documents and scene photos. It uses transformer-based feature extraction and image-to-text generation, delivering accurate recognition across diverse scripts and lay…"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "zh": "Unlimited-OCR是百度开源视觉语言模型，用于从图像中提取文本，涵盖多语言文档与场景照片。其基于Transformer特征提取及图像到文本生成技术，实现跨文字与版式的精准识别。优势包括广泛语言覆盖、稳健性能、MIT许可及社区应用广泛。典型用例涉及文档数字化、发票处理、自动化数据录入及生产级OCR流水线构建。",
        "en": "Unlimited-OCR is Baidu's open-source vision-language model that extracts text from images, including multilingual documents and scene photos. It uses transformer-based feature extraction and image-to-text generation, delivering accurate recognition across diverse scripts and layouts. Strengths include broad language coverage, robust performance, permissive MIT licensing, and strong community adoption. Typical use cases are document digitization, invoice/receipt processing, automated data entry, and building production-ready OCR pipelines.",
        "es": "Unlimited-OCR is Baidu's open-source vision-language model that extracts text from images, including multilingual documents and scene photos. It uses transformer-based feature extraction and image-to-text generation, delivering accurate recognition across diverse scripts and layouts. Strengths include broad language coverage, robust performance, permissive MIT licensing, and strong community adoption. Typical use cases are document digitization, invoice/receipt processing, automated data entry, and building production-ready OCR pipelines."
      },
